delegations.explanatoryNotes:
The list of Policies (see definition) at the time of approval of this Management DoA is:
(a) the Digital Security Framework;
(b) the accounting policies and accounting procedures (including an audit policy);
(c) the health, safety, environmental and security policy;
(d) the treasury policy;
(e) the code of conduct and compliance standards of the Group; 
(f) the communications and press policy; and
(g) the ethics and compliance policy (including the anti-bribery and corruption policy, the anti-money laundering policy, the tax transparency and anti-tax evasion policy, the conflicts of interest policy, the gifts, hospitality and entertainment policy and the speak up policy).

The Board may change this list at any time by notifying the Management Team in writing. Please note that the Board also separately approves the remuneration policy (see People section).

